FIELD NOTE: CONDUCT REGARDING "TOBI"

For newer members paired near the masked man who calls himself Tobi.

- He presents as a clumsy, talkative subordinate, forever underfoot. Deidara finds
  him insufferable. Treat this as a mask over a mask.
- Do not attack him in jest or in anger. Reports indicate strikes pass through him
  as though he were not there. Draw no conclusions aloud.
- Do not pry into his true face or name. Curiosity here is not rewarded.
- Do not assume he is beneath you in the chain of command merely because he acts it.
- Whatever you privately suspect about who truly leads this organisation, keep it
  private. Speaking it is the fastest way to stop being a problem for anyone.

Cooperate. Say little. Forget you wrote this.
